            ],
            "ticketing_url": "https://www.daysinthesunfestival.com/tickets",
            "facebook": "",
            "description": "Days In The Sun is a 3 day Folk & Roots festival based in Gloucestershire.\n\n\n\nOur title comes from the Roving Crows song 'Days In The Sun', which encourages us to live our dreams, and this festival is the places where we are giving individuals and groups a space to be the best that they can be within the arts.\n\n\n\nWe are creating a save haven for artists of all ages to express themself, show their talents and sell their creations.\n\n\n\nDays In The Sun is curated jointly by Caitlin Barrett and Paul Chief O'Neill, who have programmed and curated many events for third parties over the last 20 years, leading to them creating this bespoke event which they will grow slowly as the years progress.\n\n\n\nWhether you are an artist, a potential artist, just as importantly, a lover of the arts then Days In The Sun is the place where you can be a part of a growing community of like-minded people, sharing their thoughts, feelings, creations and ambitions.",
            "runnings": {
