                    "name": "Two Boats, One River: where song and speech meet",
                    "description": "Music and storytelling are deeply connected. They share cadence and pace, and underscore each other perfectly. But what about the voice? This workshop will focus on the inherent musicality and rhythm of language. Beginning from the premise that all natural speech is musical in its chime and chatter, we will explore the full vocal range of speech, playing with pitch, tone and rhythm, and finding ways to support and enhance the telling of a story.",
                    "limited_places": 20,
                    "booking_url": "https://artemis-storytelling.co.uk/tickets",
